{'symbol': 'KLAC', 'date': '2022-12-15 13:11:00', 'title': 'KLA FOUNDATION INVESTS MORE THAN $1 MILLION IN BAY AREA AND MICHIGAN NONPROFITS TO ADVANCE SOCIAL EQUITY, ACCESS, AND EDUCATION', 'text': 'LATEST DOMESTIC GRANT CYCLE PART OF $4 MILLION TOTAL GLOBAL DISTRIBUTIONS AWARDED BY YEAR END MILPITAS, CALIF , DEC. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KLA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: KLAC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE KLA FOUNDATION\xa0RECENTLY DISTRIBUTED MORE THAN $1 MILLION IN GRANTS AND DONATIONS TO SUPPORT SOCIAL EQUITY, ACCESS, AND EDUCATION WITH AN EMPHASIS IN SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING AND MATH (STEM) IN THE BAY AREA AND SOUTHEAST MICHIGAN THIS DECEMBER. THROUGH ITS LONG HISTORY OF SUPPORTING COMMUNITY-LEVEL ORGANIZATIONS, THIS IS THE FIRST TIME THE FOUNDATION HAS MADE A SINGLE INVESTMENT OF THIS MAGNITUDE AND IMPACT.'}